🧠 AI-Powered Social Media Mental Health Detection System

 📌 Project Overview

A smart AI-integrated social media platform built using Django + Deep Learning (CNN) that detects suicidal or harmful text content before publishing posts.

The system helps create a safer digital environment by automatically analyzing user captions and blocking harmful mental-health-related content.

---

 🚀 Key Features

 👤 User Module

* User Registration & Secure Login
* Profile Management
* Upload Posts, Stories & Media
* Like, Comment & Follow Users
* Friend Request System
* Personal Chat / Messaging
* Delete & Manage Posts

---

 🛡️ Admin Module

* View All Users
* Monitor Posts & Stories
* Detect Flagged Harmful Posts
* View User Profiles
* Admin-to-User Messaging
* Content Moderation Dashboard

---

 💬 Real-Time Communication

* User ↔ User Chat
* Admin ↔ User Chat
* File/Image Sharing
* Chat History Storage

---

 🤖 AI / Deep Learning Integration

 Model Used

* Convolutional Neural Network (CNN)

 Libraries

* TensorFlow / Keras
* NumPy
* Pandas
* Scikit-learn

 Text Processing

* Tokenization
* Sequence Padding
* Embedding Layer
* Conv1D Feature Extraction

---

 📊 Dataset

Suicide Detection Dataset

Features Used

* User Caption Text

Target

* Suicidal
* Non-Suicidal

---

 ⚙️ AI Workflow

1. User uploads caption
2. Text preprocessing
3. CNN prediction
4. Harm score evaluation
5. If harmful → Block post
6. Else → Publish post

